<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P61111> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a nomen to a resource that has a title of resource that has been abbreviated for purposes of indexing or identification."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P61111> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
