<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60709> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has accompanying resource relationship with (Deprecated)"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60709> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60709> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60709> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60709> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a resource to a resource that is an augmentation of, or is augmented by, or is complemented by, or accompanies, or is accompanied by a resource. (Deprecated)"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60709> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/accompanyingResourceRelationshipWith.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60709> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "har ledsaget ressource-relation med"@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60709> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relaterer en ressource til en ressource, der er en berigelse af, eller er beriget af, eller er komplementeret af en ressource."@da .
