<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60607> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an agent to a resource that includes a contribution by an agent of rewriting a musical composition for a medium of performance different from that for which the resource was originally intended."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60607> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
