<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60614> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is art director of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60614> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an agent to a resource that includes a contribution by an agent of overseeing artists and craftspeople who build sets for moving image productions."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60614> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
