<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60458> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/status> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/RegStatus/1001> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60458> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has binder"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60458> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a resource to an agent who binds a resource."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60458> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
