<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60458> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/binder.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60458> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "har bogbinder"@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60458> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relaterer en ressource til en agent, der indbinder en ressource."@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60458> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "heeft binder"@nl .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60458> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "aineiston sitoja"@fi .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60458> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "له مسؤول عن التجليد"@ar .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60458> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "يربط مصدر بوكيل يقوم بتجليد مصدر."@ar .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60458> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Liittää aineiston sen sidonnan tekevään toimijaan."@fi .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60458> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "hat Buchbinderin/Buchbinder"@de .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60458> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Setzt eine Ressource in Beziehung zu einem Akteur, der eine Ressource bindet."@de .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60458> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "有装订者"@zh-Hans-CN .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60458> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "将一种资源与装订一种资源的一个行为者关联起来。"@zh-Hans-CN .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60458> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "könyvkötője a következő:"@hu .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60458> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Hozzákapcsol egy forrást egy ágenshez, amely beköt egy forrást."@hu .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60458> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ciltleyici ile ilişkilidir"@tr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60458> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Bir kaynağı, bir kaynağı bağlayan bir temsilci ile ilişkilendirir."@tr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60458> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "tiene vinculador"@es .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60458> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relaciona un recurso con un agente que vincula un recurso."@es .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60458> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "má vazače"@cs .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60458> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Vztahuje zdroj k agentovi, který svázal zdroj."@cs .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60458> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "hat Buchbinderin/Buchbinder"@de .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60458> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Setzt eine Ressource in Beziehung zu einem Akteur, der eine Ressource bindet."@de .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60692> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60692> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/status> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/RegStatus/1001> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60692> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is binder of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60692> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an agent to a resource that involves a responsibility of an agent for binding."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60692> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60692> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60602> .
