<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60413> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a resource to an agent who is responsible for creating a resource by pouring a liquid or molten substance into a mold and leaving it to solidify to take the shape of the mold."@fi .
