<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60847> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "是……的纪念"@zh-Hans-CN .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60847> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "将一种资源与被一种较晚资源纪念的一种资源关联起来。"@zh-Hans-CN .
