<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60026> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is commentator of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60026> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a performer who contributes to a resource by providing interpretation, analysis, or a discussion of the subject matter on a recording, film, or other audiovisual medium to a resource."@en .
