<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60065> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has court governed"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60065> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a resource to an agent that is a court governed by court rules, regardless of their official nature."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60065> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
