<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60176> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "proveniens"@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60176> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relaterer en ressource til en optegnelse over tidligere ejerskab eller opbevaring af en ressource."@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60176> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "heeft bewaargeschiedenis van resource"@nl .
