<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60775> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relaterer en ressource til detaljer om skema, standard etc., der anvendes til kodning af en ressources digitale indhold."@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60775> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "heeft details van coderingsformaat"@nl .
