<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60787> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a resource to details of a relationship of the colours and tones in an image to the colours and tones of the object reproduced. (Deprecated)"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60787> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "har detaljer om polaritet"@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60787> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relaterer en ressource til detaljer om forholdet mellem farver og nuancer i et billede samt farver og nuancer i den reproducerede genstand."@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60787> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "heeft details van polariteit"@nl .
