<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60350> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has digital file characteristic"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60350> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a resource to a technical specification relating to a digital encoding of text, image, audio, video, and other types of data in a resource."@en .
