<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60287> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is digital transfer of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60287> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a resource to a resource in a digital format that is transferred to another digital format."@en .
