<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60678> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an agent to a resource that involves a responsibility of an agent for capturing images, either electronically or on film or video stock, and often selecting and arranging the lighting."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60678> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
