<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60330> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "har distributionsbeskrivelse"@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60330> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relaterer en ressource til oplysninger, der identificerer distributionssted, distributør, eller et dato for distribution af en ressource i publiceret form."@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60330> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "heeft distributievermelding"@nl .
