<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60314> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a resource to a schema or standard that is used to encode the digital content of a resource."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60314> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
