<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60501> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a resource to a nomen that is a designation in the form of a date or other timespan that is used to indicate the first in a sequence of numbering of the parts or iterations of a resource."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60501> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
