<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60872> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "er stifter af værk til"@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60872> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relaterer en agent, der er ansvarlig for at have etableret et periodikum, en integrerende ressource eller et flerbindsværk til en ressource."@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60872> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is oprichter-actor van resource van"@nl .
