<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60178> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a resource to a resource that is an abstracting and indexing service that indexes the contents of another resource. (Deprecated)"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60178> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
