<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60178> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/indexedIn.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60178> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "er indekseret i"@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60178> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relaterer en ressource til en ressource, der er en abstracts- og indekseringsservice, der indekserer en oprindelig kildes indhold."@da .
