<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60841> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an agent to a resource that includes a contribution by an agent of applying makeup and prosthetics for a moving image production or for a musical or dramatic presentation or entertainment."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60841> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60840> .
