<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60331> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has manufacture statement"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60331> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a resource to a statement that identifies a place of manufacture, a manufacturer, or a date of manufacture of a published resource."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60331> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
