<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60885> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an agent to a resource that incorporates a contribution by an agent of manipulating, mixing and assembling the multiple tracks of an audio recording."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60885> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Remixing activities that substantially change the nature and content of the original resource, resulting in a new resource, are excluded."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60885> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60893> .
