<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60724> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "er musik til"@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60724> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relaterer en ressource til en ressource såsom en film, et skuespil, et tv-program etc., der anvender en musikressource."@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60724> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is muziek voor"@nl .
