<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60888> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/status> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/RegStatus/1001> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60888> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60888> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is music programmer of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60888> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/musicProgrammerOf.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60888> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an agent to a musical resource that incorporates a contribution by an agent of using electronic audio devices or computer software to generate sounds."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60888> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60894> .
