<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60920> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an appellation of agent in natural language and phrasing used in common discourse to an agent."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60920> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60368> .
