<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60081> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has numbering within sequence"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60081> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a resource to a nomen that is a designation that is assigned to a resource to identify its position in a sequence of individual parts of a larger resource or parts or issues of a larger resource."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60081> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60081> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Numbering may include dates or other timespans, alphanumeric or other characters, and an accompanying caption."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60081> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "har nummerering indenfor serie"@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60081> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relaterer en ressource til en sekvensbetegnelse for en del eller flere dele i en serie."@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60081> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Nummerering omfatter et tal, et bogstav, ethvert andet tegn eller en kombination af disse med eller uden tilhørende tekst og/eller en kronologisk betegnelse."@da .
