<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60737> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an agent to an agent holding an office in or commanding an agent."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60737> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
