<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60720> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/operaAdaptationOf.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60720> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "er operabearbejdelse af"@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60720> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relaterer en ressource til en ressource, der er blevet bearbejdet til opera."@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60720> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is operabewerking van"@nl .
