<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60054> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has other distinguishing characteristic of resource (Deprecated)"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60054> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a resource to a characteristic, other than form, date, or place of origin, that serves to differentiate a resource from another resource with the same preferred title of resource. (Deprecated)"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60054> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60054> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/otherDistinguishingCharacteristicOfResource.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60054> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "har andet særligt kendetegn ved ressourcen"@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60054> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relaterer en ressource til et kendetegn, bortset fra form af ressource, dato af ressource, sted af ressource, indholdstype, eller sprog, der tjener til at skelne én ressource fra en anden ressource med samme titel eller fra et navn på en anden agent."@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60493> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/> .
