<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60404> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relaterer en ressource til en agent, der er i lovlig besiddelse af en ressource."@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60404> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "heeft eigenaar"@nl .
