<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P61004> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has part timespan"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P61004> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/partTimespan.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P61004> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a timespan to a timespan that is a component of another timespan."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P61004> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
