<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60076> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has period of activity of agent"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60076> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an agent to a timespan during which an agent is active in their primary field of endeavor."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60076> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
