<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60990> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a timespan to an agent who is active in its primary field of endeavour during a timespan."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60990> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60974> .
