<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60923> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is preferred name of place of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60923> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/preferredNameOfPlaceOf.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60923> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a nomen to a place that has a name of place that is selected for preference in a specific application or context."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60923> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60548> .
