<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60668> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an agent to a resource that involves a responsibility of an agent for most of the business aspects of a production for screen, sound recording, television, webcast, etc."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60668> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
