<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60440> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has producer of unpublished resource"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60440> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a resource to an agent who is responsible for inscribing, fabricating, constructing, or other method of producing, an unpublished resource."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60440> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
