<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60395> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a resource to an agent who contributes to a resource by supervising the technical aspects of a sound or video recording session."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60395> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
