<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60914> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60914> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has relief representation"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60914> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a resource to a cartographic representation of the surface forms of the earth or other celestial body, real or imaginary, by means of special graphic methods."@en .
