<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60168> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a resource to a resource that reissues the same resource as a printed resource being described."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60168> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
