<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60705> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relaterer en kunstner, der er ansvarlig for at have skabt en tredimensionel ressource vha. modellering, billedhuggerkunst eller lignende teknik til en ressource."@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60705> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is beeldhouwer van"@nl .
