<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P61056> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a resource to a resource that has an extension plan that is changed from successive to integrating to create a resource."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P61056> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
