<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60481> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has special playback characteristic"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60481> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a resource to an equalization system, noise-reduction system, or other processing that is used in making an audio recording."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60481> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
