<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60862> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relaterer en agent til en agent, der modtager undervisning af en anden agent."@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60862> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "heeft student"@nl .
