<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60686> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has successor"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60686> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an agent who succeeds or follows a related agent to an agent."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60686> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
