<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60605> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an agent to a cartographic resource that incorporates a contribution by an agent of providing measurements or dimensional relationships for a geographic area that is represented."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60605> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
