<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60035> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/televisionProducerOf.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60035> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "er tv-producer af"@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60035> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relaterer en producer der er ansvarlig for størstedelen af de forretningsmæssige aspekter ved et tv-program, til en ressource."@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60035> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is televisieproducent van"@nl .
