<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P61074> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/transformationByGenreOf.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P61074> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a resource to a resource that has a genre that is changed to create a resource."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P61074> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
