<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P61070> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/hasSubproperty> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P61068> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P61070> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/hasSubproperty> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P61072> .
