<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60867> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an agent to an agent who grants powers of administration to an officer in order to act for its benefit."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60867> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60866> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60867> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60737> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60867> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "er forvalter af"@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60867> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relaterer en agent til en agent, der giver administrationsbeføjelser til en embedsmand til at agere i dens interesse."@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60867> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is trustee van"@nl .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P60867> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "هو مدير عام لـ"@ar .
