<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P61167> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a nomen to a resource that has an appellation in natural language that is taken from a vocabulary encoding scheme or is constructed using a string encoding scheme."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P61167> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P61167> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/accessPointForResourceOf.en> .
