<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P61222> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a resource to a resource of a collection resource that is a discrete component of a resource of another collection resource."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P61222> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P61222> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/subcollection.en> .
