<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P61229> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is location of resource of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P61229> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a place to a resource that is held, stored, or made available for access in a place."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P61229> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/P61229> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/u/locationOfResourceOf.en> .
